---
title: "Greenlight — Finding Lifecycle · the closed loop"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Candidate

  Candidate: <b>Candidate</b><br/>a deterministic detector fired<br/>no claim made yet
  Adjudicated: <b>Adjudicated</b><br/>model matched it to a clause
  Dropped: <b>Dropped</b><br/>schema fail or clause not in allowlist<br/>counted in drops.jsonl
  Finding: <b>Finding</b><br/>rendered with citation + effective date
  Dismissed: <b>Dismissed by creator</b><br/>human override, logged
  Planned: <b>Fix planned</b><br/>mute · bleep · trim · blur
  Manual: <b>Manual review</b><br/>no safe automatic fix exists<br/>e.g. topic focus, packaging rewrite
  Rendered: <b>Rendered</b><br/>span written into fixed.mp4
  Resolved: <b>Resolved</b><br/>re-scan no longer fires on this span
  Persisted: <b>Still firing</b><br/>fix insufficient · escalate to manual

  Candidate --> Adjudicated: passes Zod
  Candidate --> Dropped: fails schema
  Adjudicated --> Dropped: clause_id not in allowlist
  Adjudicated --> Finding: clause_id verified
  Finding --> Dismissed: creator unchecks it
  Finding --> Planned: remediation is automatable
  Finding --> Manual: remediation type is manual_review
  Planned --> Rendered: ffmpeg filter_complex
  Rendered --> Resolved: re-scan clean
  Rendered --> Persisted: re-scan still fires
  Persisted --> Manual
  Dismissed --> [*]
  Resolved --> [*]
  Manual --> [*]
  Dropped --> [*]

  note right of Resolved
    This transition is the demo.
    Red band becomes green,
    on camera, in one click.
  end note
